+**HOSTILE GATE — ACTUAL-STABILIZER SCREEN — Astra — 2026-09-06**
+
+**VERDICT: CONFIRMED-WITH-FIX.** The denominator version of Lemma A and the
+necessity of the actual-stabilizer screen are proved below. My independent census
+gives **24,063 -> 1,420 coarse -> 90 actual**, with **20 -> 6** at n <= 100.
+The six source-row keys equal the p.202 table. There is no discrepancy in the
+claimed 90, their height distribution, or the roster intersection. **90 may replace
+1,420 as the population of this stronger necessary screen**, within the normalized
+minimal-counterexample scope. It is not a count of polynomial pairs or Moh's
