+**7. Existential patterns: sound, with the whole-tree quantifier.** A realizing
+pair supplies its actual p-root multiset at each node, its zero/nonzero choices,
+and its actual continuations at every major factor. Lemma A supplies the modulus
+for each of those nodes. The preceding arguments show that all these data pass
+every enumerated condition. Induction down the finite characteristic tower gives
+a passing pattern containing its specified source path. Therefore rejection only
+when **every pattern fails** cannot reject the row of such a pair.
