+Since `Lcal_j` divides coarse L_j, coarse A_j divides actual A_j. An actual orbit
+can be split into smaller coarse orbits, preserving multiplicities and total root
+count; bottom divisibilities weaken as well. Thus actual acceptance implies coarse
+acceptance. Using the coarse census as an outer population is sound; no actual row
+is lost before the stronger screen runs.
